            "id": 148292,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba os arrays <code>scores</code> e <code>bonuses</code> passando-os para a função <code>searchBonus</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"173\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"174\" /><option startIndex=\"175\" endIndex=\"182\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores = [\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3600\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonuses = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores, bonuses\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scores);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bonuses);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchBonus(scores, bonuses);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>scores</code> seguido de <code>,</code> e finalmente <code>bonuses</code>.</p></body></html>"
